OL,3,GNEWSAPeatland housing approved with
OL,4,A'heavy hearts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 125 houses on peatland
OL,7,Fin Cheshire have been approved by
OL,8,Fcouncillors, who said they backed the
OL,9,Fplans "with a heavy heart".
OL,11,FThe site off Cumber Lane in Wilmslow is
OL,12,Fclose to where the Lindow Man - a 2,000
OL,13,Fyear old bog body - was found in the
OL,14,F1980s.
OL,16,FOne councillor said he voted for the
OL,17,Fplans because the council did not "have
OL,18,Fa chance in hell of actually winning an
OL,19,Fappeal".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
