OL,3,GNEWSAPeatland housing approved with
OL,4,A'heavy hearts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Goldsmith, who spoke
OL,7,Fagainst the plans, said councillors
OL,8,F"get blamed but this is national policy
OL,9,Fin practice" while a local resident
OL,10,Fsaid the decision was "hugely, hugely
OL,11,Fdisappointing".
